            "id": 6667334,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 全福生技(6885)股價殺至跌停，跌停價26.4元，成交552張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>全福生技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6885:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6885\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6885-TW</a>)19日11:30下跌2.9元，股價跌停報26.4元，委買103張、委賣3張，成交552張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為新藥開發。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>全福生技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6885:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6885\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6885-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌0.68%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌9.18%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-118 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-116 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-2 張</li> <li>融資增減：+211 張</li> <li>融券增減：0 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
